# Project Agent Instructions

Read and follow `WORKSPACE.md` first. Then read `AIWG.md` for AIWG discovery,
quick references, and framework routing.

DeepSeek Harness loads applicable `AGENTS.md` or `CLAUDE.md` files from the
workspace. Keep this bootstrap compact: the provider instruction loader limits
each context file to 65,536 bytes.

{{REMOTES_TOPOLOGY}}
## AIWG resources

- Shared skills are discovered natively from `.agents/skills/`.
- The AIWG-owned Cordis overlay is `.dsh/aiwg.cordis.patch.yml`.
- Start one-shot work with `dsh --profile headless --patch .dsh/aiwg.cordis.patch.yml`.
- Start JSON-RPC integration with `dsh --profile sdk --patch .dsh/aiwg.cordis.patch.yml`.

Credential values must be supplied through the environment variable named by
an ephemeral route overlay. Never put credential values in this repository,
`AGENTS.md`, Cordis patches, command arguments, or session fixtures.
